														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3677711">
									

<p>As if the Sahara desert wasn’t scary enough&#8230;! Very nice ideas and good, chilling horror. There were a couple of small typos, but I fixed these for you.</p>
<p>My main criticism is that the log reads as though it were written by a modern American and not a 1940s RAF pilot. The language used is not appropriate at all. Whether you want to research the language of that period and class and employ some vernacular for better colour is of course up to you. At the very least, however, you should change the word “gasoline” to “petrol”.</p>

